#==============================================================================================
#
#   keyword_style_value - KeywordStyleValue: a CSS keyword, and the colors keywords resolve to
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/KeywordStyleValue.cpp (lines 1-405) and the inline
#       members of KeywordStyleValue.h.
#       KeywordStyleValue::create's statics (the CSS-wide keywords) are module variables made in the C
#       heap on first use, as r36's CounterStyle statics.
